                                                "sense_id": "dd5bddf6-8e39-30ca-8485-e479dcaa444b",
                                                "text": "Similitude applies to proportional changes, such as doublings, halvings, or quarterings; it does not apply to additive changes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f9d2f0ae-3c92-37db-a97f-e7fa23108e59",
                                        "entry_id": "4c9e486b-87c7-3428-b320-03e424dd10c7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of providing housing for military personnel, especially when imposed upon the home of a private citizen."
